<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand is now deploying AI-powered surveillance to target smuggling syndicates while police in Chiang Rai seized 350 kg of meth hidden in a water truck, and floods have killed 71 people and affected nearly 908,000 households. The fruit sector faces a deepening labour shortage that is prompting the government to plan hiring workers from Sri Lanka for the first time. A major crackdown on cross-border financial scams resulted in 39 arrests and the seizure of THB500 million in assets. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/10/15/thailand-bangkok-protesters-decry-imf-and-world-bank-warn-of-destructive-capitalism&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPdWkwOUtfaE1JMGE0WFBIcm5POWpockpURkNoVzhjLWFCS3FVOEVRRlk2M3UwWXFFMGs3ZnREbmdvLU41S1hTaWdMVlVLeGhLTzdRSURJTGRuWGxMeFFoZVIycWlyZld1SjByRW5mcS1KVnBzc3JuMXJ6YmxuUVc5ejFOWXVRZTY5OE1ic2J1MFZFLUJNanJIWG5YMlpTSnRNUzhoTU9IRmUwdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Cambodianess&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNWk45UmNId1ZsMEU1bmtSWC0wcS1NeFN0LTNiVUlJNUJfOWhBVkZDMGxRNVQtVlhaanhnYXFFSUdFTjZrSTBFMzZYbnRkM3NDRGZrOW5sRzBqd0tfR2F5czZGZW5tTWpZVWYycXd0NkRqUTdlZ0VjUDF1eVRVbGxPUDF6Qk12VGJmLXZaNTdjd3dHeDM1ZU1JV1hNaGZ6Y3NPaGdWZFo0c0I4MVRlVXRsb0hIdUhZaXcyeFpjbVdCbzlLZXY2VGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQdjZiOHlPY01rOS0zRXM1SU5hOUJRd3AwcVl4djNJOE8ybzJuaXFySDJaNC1wNXJ5Vk9RQk9BdFpKYzdXSW5jV3V1bzc5TlFZRUY1QVpMZWdyT2Z4a00weTdCY0NRRkFaaVRZbmxVRVFnUVh0QnNiTXpZc1JqdjVVRUIzTTJDelhxY3hoVU5TRldfNWllWmVEbVJkR1VTVzgwdmxzcFdlclBJWE1EYXZPSF9Tcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPcHNfUnpNTU